# ---- pipeline-health hub sync stall (optional — hub only) ----
# bin/harness-sync.sh records state/harness-sync-last-success and, when it
# refuses a deploy, state/harness-sync-last-refused. bin/pipeline-health.sh
# pages "the hub has not synced in N hours" once an hour once the freeze passes
# HUB_SYNC_STALL_S (default 3600), and escalates to a --critical lane-alert
# (Telegram, DM when the monitor is off) past HUB_SYNC_CRITICAL_S (default
# 14400). It resolves itself the moment a deploy lands.
#HUB_SYNC_STALL_S=3600
#HUB_SYNC_CRITICAL_S=14400

